window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Snubbed. Jilted. Exiled.</i></b></p> <p>Being left at the altar would have been better. Instead, I'm sent away to a secluded spot where I can't disturb the happy couple--on my honeymoon without a bride.</p> <p>Left to lick my wounds and recover from the ultimate betrayal, I do what I do best.</p> <p>No, not admit defeat. Not recover my dignity like I'm unaffected.</p> <p><b>Plot revenge.</b> </p> <p>Lucky for me, I have a companion on this otherwise lonely island.</p> <p>The only question is...will she be the victim of my revenge schemes?</p> <p><i>Or my partner in crime?</i></p> <p>*If you have triggers, my work is not for you.</p>"; 
